runAllTests;req;r;tests;t;fq
⍝ Unified runner for all test*.aplf functions in db/tests/.
⍝ Uses one consistent execution/reporting pattern.

:If 0=⎕NC'null'
    init 'lib/'
:EndIf

req←{0::⍺,' - FAILED: ',⎕DMX.Message ⋄ ⍵:⍺,' - OK' ⋄ ⍺,' - FAILED'}
r←⊂'Run All Tests'

tests←' ' (≠⊆⊢) 'test testPhase1 testPhase2 testApiCoverageBatchA testApiCoverageBatchB testApiCoverageBatchC testApiCoverageBatchD testApiCoverageBatchE testApiCoverageBatchF testArrow testArrowConversion testArrowConversionRuntime testArrowConversionSchemaRuntime testArrowConversionChunkRuntime testArrowFromRuntime testAppenderMetadataDefault testAppenderDefaultToChunk testPreparedColumnMetadata testPreparedParameterMetadata testResultMetadataWrappers testResultColumnMetadata testExtractedStatements testDateTimeHelpers testClientContext testConfigFlags testPendingHelpers testPendingCheckState testValueApiBatch1 testValueApiBatch2 testValueApiBatch3 testValueApiCoverage'

:For t :In tests
    fq←'tests.',t
    :If 3=⎕NC fq
        :Trap 0
            ⍎fq
            r,←⊂'Executed ',fq,' - OK'
        :Else
            r,←⊂'Executed ',fq,' - FAILED: ',⎕DMX.Message
        :EndTrap
    :Else
        r,←⊂'Missing ',fq,' - FAILED'
    :EndIf
:EndFor

⎕←↑r
⎕←''
⎕←'Unified test run complete.'

⍝ KSL 1.0.0
